[agent] ## What I produced
[agent] **`workspace.mlpabef05e2.churntraining605fb7`** — a managed Delta table (versioned by Delta) in the per-run schema, with exactly the required columns and one row per `labels.csv` row.
[agent] | Column | Type | Source |
[agent] |---|---|---|
[agent] | account_id | string | labels |
[agent] | label_time | bigint | labels |
[agent] | amount | double | transactions (+late) |
